A||X||38||Voytek||Radio DJ Part II: OK EVERYONE, I NEED YOUR HELP||||8||
Z||000000||Voytek||12-10-2001||02:08 PM||||Ok.  A little background.<BR>On Friday I posted a topic on a local DJ who made some comments about how all Fieros should be taken off the road.  I sent him a rather friendly e-mail and even offered to take him for a ride in my '87 GT.<P>Part 2:<BR>I have received no reply.  On Friday afternoon (about 4:30) I received a phonecall from a friend, asking me if I'd sent an e-mail to Power107.  I said Yes.  'Well,' he says, 'the guy is just making fun of you on the radio right now'.  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>What did he say?  Well, this is what he STARTED with: he said (w/o using my name) that I shouldn't get all sentimental about a no-good '80's car and I should get a life.  Fine.  I can accept that.  BUT, that's not all.<P>As I got in my car to leave work, I tuned to the station and what do I hear?  The man declared the Friday as Fiero Friday (sarcasm).  I have listened to the station off an on that evening to hear comments like this: 'Fieros are all crap', 'they look like the 80's', 'they should be taken off the road', etc.  <P>Wait, there is more.  The guy announced that he will be taking calls from people to hear their Fiero stories.  Well, here's one of the calls: some bimbo calls in and says 'didn't those cars have like the engine in the back, and like when they got hit they would explode?'  the DJ: 'yeah, something like that'.<P>In fact, the ONLY calls I've heard were all negative!!  Imagine: THE WHOLE EVENING BASHING FIEROS ON THE RADIO!!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>For those of you who aren't familiar with Calgary: it is a city of 1 million people.  This station is 1 of the 4 top stations on FM.<P>NOW:  Your mission, should you choose to accept it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"> , is to e-mail this prick and tell him what you think about his derogatory Fiero comments.<P>His e-mail address is maz@power107.com (Maz McFly).  We have about 3000 members here.  It would be cool if he got even a quarter of us telling him what we think about him.<P>BTW: this isn't the first time this has happened.  This station loves bashing the Fiero on a regular basis.<P>Go at it.  I've already sent in my complaint. I'll let you know if I get a reply this time.  This almost warrants a trip down to the radio station.<P> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif">  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"><P>------------------<BR> <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif"> ||||reg||8
