Z||000006||RRobinson||12-10-2001||03:05 PM||||Hey Voytek, <BR>I just replied to your other topic without noticing this one. My point was that we should let 'em insult the Fiero because it makes 'em cheaper for us to buy. However...<P>Complaining or trying to explain just encourages the Fiero Bashing. Let their lame-ass "Powder 107" music speak for itself.<P>RR<P>||||reg||1
Z||000007||Voytek||12-10-2001||03:09 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Jaei Sun:<BR><B>Just goes to show you should have just let it slide and not e-mailed him in the first place.<P>But maybe it's a good thing now people think they're even more shitty so now you'll be albe buy them for a lot cheaper hopefully.<P>I kinda like it when the fiero gets bad press... just makes em cheaper for those who know better.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Jaei - this isn't the first time this station has bashed the Fiero.<P>Thanks for your comments.  The comments don't help if you're trying to sell a fiero.  Since you don't have anything supportive to say, and the thread does ask for support (please re-read), I suggest you stick to reading other threads.<BR>||||reg||1
Z||000008||Voytek||12-10-2001||03:17 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by RRobinson:<BR><B>Hey Voytek, <BR>I just replied to your other topic without noticing this one. My point was that we should let 'em insult the Fiero because it makes 'em cheaper for us to buy. However...<P>Complaining or trying to explain just encourages the Fiero Bashing. Let their lame-ass "Powder 107" music speak for itself.<P>RR<P></B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P><BR>Yeah, lame-ass music is right.  I haven't been listening to them for quite a while now - they do suck.  For some reason I, mistakenly, tuned in on Thursday hoping to hear this one song.  Just my luck, I hear Fiero bashing.<P>Whatever.  The guy ACTUALLY just replied to my e-mail from this morning.  W/O swearing, I wasn't as nice today.  I told him I'd give hime 24 hrs to reply before 'I take further action' (whatever that may mean, right?).  Well, he came back shortly after that with an e-mail saying that it's just entertainment and, really, they didn't mean any of it.  In fact, he claims, they were objective and played one guy who said he liked his Fiero.<P>I've heard that call.  First the guy said his fiero exploded on him.  Then he went on to say how Fieros are actually pretty good cars.  That was the only positive call.<P>Before I didn't particularly care for this station, but I truly hate it now.<P>I still encourage all to send this guy an e-mail.  We all got pi$$ed off when magazines knocked the Fiero years ago.  Now it's continuing on the radio.||||reg||1
