Z||000013||Galen||12-10-2001||04:36 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Voytek:<BR><B> <BR>Jaei - this isn't the first time this station has bashed the Fiero.<P>Thanks for your comments.  The comments don't help if you're trying to sell a fiero.  Since you don't have anything supportive to say, and the thread does ask for support (please re-read), I suggest you stick to reading other threads.</B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>And people were saying my posts were wastes of time, I agree with you Voytek. Jaie Sun is an .. well, I wont say it to keep things flameless but he is  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> hehe<P>------------------<BR><B><FONT COLOR="purple">Ray</FONT></B> - <A HREF="http://www.fierolinks.f2s.com/index.shtml" TARGET=_blank>Fierolinks</A>||||reg||1
