Z||000020||Cliff Pennock||12-10-2001||05:43 PM||||Ehm, guys? That's exactly what he wants y'all to do. He wants you to call him, he wants you to email him, he wants you to drive to the station. You are giving him material that will last him for months!<P>I mean, think about it. The guy has never seen a Fiero up close, let alone driven one. He really has no opinion whatsoever on the car. All he's doing is creating a topic to fill his airtime. He's probably telling his friends in a bar: "oh - them Fieros are probably ok cars but those reactions I'm getting are cracking me up!".<P>C'mon guys. He's a radio DJ. He probably got his head stuck up his producer's ass so high he doesn't need a reverb unit! Just ignore him. He's a monkey with a mike. And if you really want to do something about it, contact GM that one of the major radio stations in Calgary is doing damage to their name.||||reg||1
