Z||000022||Jaei Sun||12-10-2001||06:00 PM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Ehm, guys? That's exactly what he wants y'all to do. He wants you to call him, he wants you to email him, he wants you to drive to the station. You are giving him material that will last him for months!<BR>I mean, think about it. The guy has never seen a Fiero up close, let alone driven one. He really has no opinion whatsoever on the car. All he's doing is creating a topic to fill his airtime. He's probably telling his friends in a bar: "oh - them Fieros are probably ok cars but those reactions I'm getting are cracking me up!".<P>C'mon guys. He's a radio DJ. He probably got his head stuck up his producer's ass so high he doesn't need a reverb unit! Just ignore him. He's a monkey with a mike. And if you really want to do something about it, contact GM that one of the major radio stations in Calgary is doing damage to their name.<HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>That's exactly what I was thinking.  Just didn't come out that way in my earlier post.  Anyone see that Fraiser episode where Fraiser was getting hassled by the two shock jocks at the station.  That's what comes to mind here.||||reg||1
Z||000023||Shaun41178||12-10-2001||06:09 PM||||HAHAHA that guy cracks me up.  But on a  good note every friday will now be called Fiero friday.  Something good came out of it like the fiero name popping up every friday.<P>If I was a Dj and knew that a bit like that would upset so many people, I would do it as well just to piss you guys off.  Grow the hell up!!!  You aren't going to change his mind and just giving him more material.  Like I said if I was a DJ and knew talk like that would upset a group of people that really don't matter, I would give them a hard time too.  I mean how many Fiero lovers do you think there are in the listening station of that area?  Do you think he is going to give a crap if a whole 5 stop listening but he gets hundreds of others to listen by going on with this bit?  Hell no he won't.  In fact I wouldnt' give a crap either.<P>Stop being 5 years old<P>------------------<BR>Sold Nitrous 85 GT.<BR>Looking for another.<BR>FOR SALE: Aluminum v6 block.<BR>Shaun41178@hotmail.com<BR>PORN FOREVER!||||reg||1
