Z||000029||Jaygee79||12-10-2001||10:59 PM||||I'll definitely email him.  What you SHOULD do is call him up and ask to be put on the air.  when you get on there, tell him that he should go for a ride with you in yours and then see if he still feels the same way about them.  If he won't then at least you're on the air and you can say what you think of him  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/wink.gif"><P>------------------<BR><FONT COLOR="purple">Jaime<BR>AOL IM: Jaygee79   ICQ: 85931334</FONT><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jaygee79sig.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000030||SLAMMED87GT||12-11-2001||12:58 AM||||I'm going to reply with a post to this subject that might get me some flames, but you need to here it!<P>As a radio D.J. myself, I see exactly what's going on here. BTW, I D.J. for the number #1 rock station in central MN, and our target demographic is the male audience of 18-49.<P>A radio d.j. for a rock station is a entertainer. He entertains his/her audience by finding something the audience likes, and if he's successful, rides the horse for as long as he can. The longer he's on that horse, the more the people he gets to listen, the better the ratings, the more reveue for the station. It's pretty simple. When I D.J. I say things that will offend certain people, but a lot more people are going to enjoy it so to me that's good. If I do not entertain my audience than they might look somewhere else for a different station that might have a better D.J. The more people I entertain, the more the audience grows, the better the ratings, the more money I make. Actually, the last part of that sentence doesn't seem to apply to me.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>Some people have said it already, do nothing.<BR>The more you reply to this guy, the more you hassle him, and the more you bring the subject up, the longer he's going to use it on his show. He see's that your upset. He see's that you are pissed. He see's that this is going to be a great stint for him....<P>Not everyone likes Fieros. If this guy was talking about ricers instead, a lot of you would be on the floor laughing. Do you think the ricers are going to reply? Maybe a few, but they wouldn't put as much effort into as some of you seem to be doing and it would probably be forgotten. <P>You can't make everyone like Fieros. So don't waste your time trying to.<P>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/Pfierosig2_1.jpg">  <P>------------------<BR>3" Drop, 17" Primax 618s/Nitto450 205/40, 4" Monza exhaust, Mudstain decklid scoop, 7" wing stands, Clear front and rear lights, custom interior, all options...that's all hehe.<p>[This message has been edited by SLAMMED87GT (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||6
