Z||000033||Jimmy||12-11-2001||03:10 AM||||Hey Jaei Sun try to be more supportive!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif">  Way to tell him Gailen.   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/rolleyes.gif"><P>Jim||||reg||1
Z||000034||Voytek||12-11-2001||10:42 AM||||Thanks Jimmy!<P>Jefrysuko - let me get that pry bar so I can get your lips off Cliff's butt.<P>Shaun41178 - 'Grow the hell up'??!!  'Stop being 5 years old'??!!!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/mad.gif"> Who th' hell are YOU?! This is the kind of bull$hit that I am tired of; people with unwanted advice.  On almost every topic on PFF some cocky wisea$$ comes in with unwanted remarks.  Did I ask you what you think of this???!!!!  Go back and re-read the topic, moron.<P>You see, you've got this all wrong.  THIS ISN'T A DEBATE.<P>Slammed87GT - yeah, I know what you're saying but the radio shouldn't be used for some personal vendetta.  If I wanted for this to go on the air, I would've phoned in.  I was quite polite with my original request.  Having a radio mike at his disposal doesn't give him the right to be an a$$hole.<P>In fact, Cliff is right and that's EXACTLY what I did yesterday morning.  I told the guy that airing unsubstantiated comments like 'these cars have the engine in the back and explode when they get hit' is a derogatory comment about a GM product.  I told him that comments like this may hurt GM sales in this city and I am considering contacting GM about this.<P>THEN, and only then, he wrote me back.  He actually got pretty defensive and claimed he played some good comments too (but couldn't come up with any).<P>In fact, what Flashy is talking about is correct.  The guy did make one more mention (I missed it) about why people are mad at him, and guess what?  There were NO MORE comments about the Fiero last night.<P>To all those of you who suggested sticking my head in the sand: it might work for you in your life - I'm all about standing up for yourself.<P>To all those who contacted the station (Springtyme, jelly2m8, ejayerik, Jaygee79 and anyone I missed) - thanks and thanks to others (Flashy, Brandon, Posthumane, Jimmy, Galen and others) for support.  That's exactly what I was looking for.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/voyteks_sig2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by Voytek (edited 12-11-2001).]||||reg||1
Z||000035||Butter||12-11-2001||11:22 AM|||| <BLOCKQUOTE><font size="1" face="Verdana, Arial, Helvetica">quote:</font><HR>Originally posted by Cliff Pennock:<BR><B>C'mon guys. He's a radio DJ. He probably got his head stuck up his producer's ass so high he doesn't need a reverb unit! Just ignore him. He's a monkey with a mike. </B><HR></BLOCKQUOTE><P>LMAO  <IMG SRC="http://www.duhspot.com/users/smiley/s/contrib/lilly/hmm3grin2orange.gif"> <P>Voytek,<BR>Have him put up or shut up.  Take him for a <B>REAL</B> ride!  If he don't want to take the bait lead him to another car/subject too talk about.  <B>Remember</B> he has the mic. Monkey see, Monkey do.<P><P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/buttersig_1.gif"> ||||reg||12
